arden</h2><strong>Yootek IoT internship</strong><p>Wrote ESP32/ESP-IDF firmware for an enterprise IoT platform with a NestJS, PostgreSQL, Prisma, MQTT and WebSocket backend, including JWT auth and role-based access control.</p></article></div></div><div class="history-column history-column--education"><div class="history-column-head"><span class="mono-label">Education</span></div><div class="history-list"><article data-history-item="true"><span>2022 - 2026</span><h2>Hanoi University of Science and Technology</h2><strong>Information Technology</strong><p>Bachelor of Engineering in Information Technology, specialising in embedded systems and industrial firmware.</p></article></div></div></section></div></div></section><footer class="frame-footer"><span>firmware engineer</span><span>can / misra / iot</span><span>@CatKod</span></footer></div></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><div aria-hidden="true" class="target-cursor"><div class="target-cursor-rotor"><span class="target-cursor-corner target-cursor-corner--tl"></span><span class="target-cursor-corner target-cursor-corner--tr"></span><span class="target-cursor-corner target-cursor-corner--br"></span><span class="target-cursor-corner target-cursor-corner--bl"></span></div><span class="target-cursor-dot"></span></div><script src="/_next/static/chunks/186c.u8l76ivb.js" id="_R_" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[76902,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0wpriid5pfq~o.js\"],\"RouteTransition\"]\n3:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/01xlw8hd842-c.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\"],\"default\"]\n4:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/01xlw8hd842-c.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\"],\"default\"]\n5:I[44434,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0wpriid5pfq~o.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/09f~j.yqvpkh..js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/03lu_-.84~_q..catkod.0107a74b.js\"],\"InitialLoader\"]\n6:I[53173,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0wpriid5pfq~o.js\",\"/_n